Theorem standard_simplex_thm : forall p :e omega, standard_simplex p = {x :e R :^: omega | (forall i :e omega, 0 <= x i /\ x i <= 1) /\ ((forall i :e omega, p < i -> x i = 0) /\ finsum {i :e omega | 0 <= i /\ i <= p} (fun x0:set => x x0) = 1)}.
Admitted.

